# Fragment analysis (#201): single points of a complex and of its fragments at
# the complex's geometry, for the Fragment orbitals box (ecce-fragorb).
recipe: fragment-analysis
title: Fragment analysis
field: Bonding
summary: The complex and each fragment at the complex's geometry; its orbitals in fragment orbitals
description: A single point of the complex and one of each fragment set below, all at the complex's geometry with the same method and basis set. When they have finished, the Fragment orbitals box expands each orbital of the complex in the orbitals of the fragments. Apply it after a finished calculation of the complex to use that calculation's final geometry.
role: sp | Complex and fragments | PBE0 | def2-SVP | one method and basis set for every step: the fragments' orbitals are expanded in the complex's basis
rules: heavy-ecp, size, registered

variant: orca | ORCA | ORCA
step: orca | complex | ORCA | sp | Energy | single point of the complex | structure
step: orca | fragment | ORCA | sp | Energy | single point of a fragment | fragment
link: orca | complex | fragment | geometry
